.TH MPVPAPER-WALLPAPER 1 "2026-10-16" "mpvpaper-dde 0.1.0-4" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mpvpaper-wallpaper \- launcher for the mpvpaper dynamic video wallpaper on deepin V25 / UOS 25 (Treeland)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mpvpaper-wallpaper
[\fICONF\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Starts
.BR mpvpaper (1)
on the desktop background layer of the deepin / UOS 25 Treeland compositor,
playing the video configured in
.IR CONF .
.PP
The launcher runs mpvpaper in the background, keeps the static placeholder
wallpaper in sync while the video layer is up, and exits cleanly on
SIGTERM/SIGINT (IPC quit, then TERM, then KILL after a 3 s grace period),
pausing and resuming playback on session lock and unlock together with
.BR mpvpaper-wallpaper-watch (1).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.I CONF
Configuration file to load. Defaults to
.IR ~/.config/mpvpaper-wallpaper.conf .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/mpvpaper-wallpaper.conf
User configuration: video source (VIDEO=), mpv options, output autodetection.
.TP
.I /usr/share/mpvpaper-dde/mpvpaper-wallpaper.conf
Packaged default configuration; copy it to the user path to customize.
.SH SERVICES
.B systemd --user start mpvpaper-wallpaper.service
runs this command as a user unit.
.B mpvpaper-wallpaper-watch.service
keeps the video state aligned with the session lock state and the official
wallpaper selection.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mpvpaper (1),
.BR mpvpaper-wallpaper-watch (1),
.BR mpvpaper-wallpaper-ui (1)
